PART 5: IMPROVE THE SHIPPING QUOTATION ESTIMATOR

The quotation estimator is an important part of Swiftvero. Keep it, but make it much easier to use.

The estimator should collect only the information required at each stage.

Initial information

* Origin.
* Destination.
* Package category.
* Estimated actual weight.
* Dimensions, where known.
* Service option.
* Collection or drop-off preference.
* Package photo, where required.
* Contents declaration.

