PART 6: PICKUP AND DROP-OFF EXPERIENCE

Retain the existing collection options but present them clearly.

Standard pickup

Standard doorstep pickup is free within eligible service areas, subject to availability.

The target is collection within 24 hours after confirmation, subject to operating hours and operational capacity.

Do not promise universal collection coverage.

Priority pickup

Priority pickup is a paid option.

The target window may be approximately 1–6 hours, depending on location, traffic, demand and driver availability.

It is not a guaranteed one-hour service.

The fee should be calculated according to approved pricing rules.

Show the option only when it is genuinely available.

Drop-off

Show verified active drop-off locations only.

Clearly display the address, operating hours and any applicable instructions.

Do not display fictional branches or collection centres.

Collection confirmation

After collection:

* Record the pickup agent.
* Record the collection time.
* Capture proof of collection.
* Update the shipment timeline.
* Notify the customer.

Agents should not falsely record the package as weighed at the customer’s doorstep.

The package is weighed and measured after arrival at the appropriate Swiftvero facility.

